# Nothing secret goes into the browser build.
# Set these in Cloudflare → Workers & Pages → (project) → Settings → Variables and Secrets:
#   TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN   token of the new orders bot (from @BotFather)
#   TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID     chat that receives orders
#   GEMINI_API_KEY       free key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   GEMINI_MODEL         optional, defaults to gemini-2.5-flash
